# Vercel only hosts the static cross-device viewer (cloud.html + pulse.css) from this repo.
# Everything else here is the local server/CLI tooling and Supabase source, which:
#   - server.js would otherwise get auto-detected as a "legacy Node.js" entrypoint and
#     wrapped as a serverless function, which 403s on every request (it expects to run
#     persistently on your own PC, reading ~/.claude, not per-request in a sandbox)
#   - supabase/ is deployed separately via the Supabase CLI, not Vercel
server.js
supabase
Start Claude Pulse.cmd
Stop Claude Pulse.cmd
launch-hidden.vbs
index.html
SUPABASE-SETUP.md
